---
// src/components/bangalore/BangaloreHero.astro
---
<section class="relative bg-slate-50 pt-8 sm:pt-16 pb-8 sm:pb-16 overflow-hidden w-full border-b border-slate-200">
  <!-- Main Content container (Centered) -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 rounded-full bg-slate-900/5 border border-slate-900/10 text-slate-600 font-medium text-xs mb-6 sm:mb-8">
      <span>For <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Bengaluru</span> restaurants</span>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-5xl leading-[1.05] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6 lg:mb-8">
      One payment a week. <br class="hidden sm:block"/>
      <span class="text-slate-900">Nobody checks it.</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-600 font-medium mb-2 sm:mb-3 leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Thousands of 
      <span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-slate-800">
        <img src="/brand-s.png" alt="" class="h-[1.2em] w-auto object-contain mr-1.5" /> Swiggy
      </span> 
      and 
      <span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-slate-800">
        <img src="/zomato.png" alt="" class="h-[1.2em] w-auto object-contain mr-1.5" /> Zomato
      </span> 
      orders go into one weekly payment.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-600 font-medium mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Commission, discounts, ad charges, penalties. All cut before it reaches your bank.
    </p>
    
    <div class="mb-8 sm:mb-10 max-w-2xl w-full">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-800 font-bold leading-snug sm:leading-relaxed">
        Send us your last month. We find every wrong charge, and apply for a claim where possible.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full max-w-md mx-auto">
      <a href="#free-check" class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-5 sm:px-12 sm:py-5 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black rounded text-slate-900 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1DA851] transition-transform shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(79,70,229,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        Get my free check
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium mt-4">
        Free for the next 20 restaurants.
      </p>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
